sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant React as React Frontend
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant Fast as FastAPI Router
    participant Val as Input Validator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Graph as LangGraph Engine
    participant Sup as Supervisor LLM
    participant GeoC as Geomaterial Collector
    participant LocC as Locality Collector
    participant VegaA as Vega Plot Agent
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant Azure as Azure OpenAI

    User->>React: Query: Map minerals in Korea
    React->>Auth: Validate Session Token
    Auth-->>React: Token Valid
    
    React->>Fast: POST /api/agent/chat
    Note over React,Fast: message, session_id, user_id
    
    Fast->>Val: Validate Input
    Note over Val: length, security, domain
    Val-->>Fast: Valid Query
    
    Fast->>DB: Load or Create Session
    Note over DB: Save user_id and session_id<br/>to sessions table
    DB-->>Fast: Session Ready
    
    Fast->>DB: Save User Message
    Note over DB: Insert message into<br/>messages table
    DB-->>Fast: Message ID
    
    Fast->>Graph: Initialize LangGraph State
    Note over Graph: messages, user_query, session_id
    Graph->>Sup: Execute Supervisor Node
    
    Sup->>Azure: Analyze Query Intent
    Note over Sup,Azure: LLM reasoning
    Azure-->>Sup: Route Decision: Need location<br/>data and visualization
    
    Sup->>Graph: Multi-Agent Dispatch
    
    par Parallel Agent Execution
        Graph->>LocC: Execute Locality Collector
        LocC->>MCP: collect_localities country=Korea
        MCP-->>LocC: locations, elements, ore_info
        LocC->>Azure: Refine Location Data
        Note over LocC,Azure: LLM processing
        Azure-->>LocC: Enriched localities
        LocC->>Graph: Locality Agent Complete
        
        Graph->>GeoC: Execute Geomaterial Collector
        GeoC->>MCP: collect_geomaterials filters
        MCP-->>GeoC: minerals, hardness, formula
        GeoC->>Azure: Rank by Relevance
        Note over GeoC,Azure: LLM scoring
        Azure-->>GeoC: Ranked minerals
        GeoC->>Graph: Geomaterial Agent Complete
    end
    
    Graph->>VegaA: Execute Vega Plot Agent
    VegaA->>MCP: profile_sample_data
    Note over MCP: locations, minerals
    MCP-->>VegaA: schema, types, ranges
    VegaA->>Azure: Generate Vega-Lite Spec
    Note over VegaA,Azure: chart configuration
    Azure-->>VegaA: JSON spec with mark and encoding
    VegaA->>Graph: Vega Agent Complete
    
    Graph->>Sup: Aggregate Agent Results
    Sup->>Azure: Generate Natural Language Response
    Note over Sup,Azure: findings and summary
    Azure-->>Sup: Summary and insights
    
    Graph-->>Fast: FINISH with AgentQueryResponse
    Note over Graph,Fast: text, chart_spec, data, session_id
    
    Fast->>DB: Save Agent Output
    Note over DB: Insert agent_output<br/>with response data
    DB-->>Fast: Output saved
    
    Fast-->>React: Response with message<br/>and visualization
    
    React->>React: Render Output
    Note over React: VegaChart, DataTable, Message
    React-->>User: Interactive heatmap<br/>Mineral distribution in Korea